        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**BlackTroll** gives TrollStore a black Home Screen icon. The blue background turns black and the face stays white, so it sits with dark icon themes.\n\nIt repaints the icon inside SpringBoard only. Nothing inside TrollStore is changed, so removing BlackTroll puts the stock icon back.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "How to use"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "1. Install BlackTroll. Sileo resprings and the icon turns black.\n2. To turn it off, open Settings \u2192 BlackTroll, switch off **Enabled**, then flip **Respring to apply**.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
