          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Good to know"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Works on the Home Screen, dock, folders and App Library while jailbroken. Without a jailbreak the stock blue icon shows. If an icon theme already replaces TrollStore's icon, the theme's icon is what gets repainted.",
